\description{
This page describes the \code{pattern} argument shared by all rure
functions. \code{pattern} is a single character string containing a
regular expression, written in the syntax supported by the Rust
\href{https://docs.rs/regex/latest/regex/}{\code{regex}} crate, specifically
the \href{https://docs.rs/regex/latest/regex/bytes/}{\code{regex::bytes}}
